    "Create an encrypted backup of your ChillMate data. ChillMate also saves a recovery copy on your device automatically. Useful if you ever reinstall the app." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the benefits of backing up your data.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Create an encrypted backup of your ChillMate data. ChillMate also saves a recovery copy on your device automatically. Useful if you ever reinstall the app."
